            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pt-3 border-t border-gray-100">
                <span id="spotlight-phrase-category" class="text-xs uppercase font-semibold text-christmasGreen tracking-wider">pronto</span>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
